        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SB-A2, Tubular Modern Curved Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern curved tubular lever is made from stainless steel and is a part of Fusion Hardware's 2000 series. The gentle curving shape not only adds a contemporary sleek look, it fits nicely in the hand. Available in either brushed stainless steel or polished stainless steel finishes, this lever and rose set will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SB-A2 Simple Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple SB-A2 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Curved Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SB-A2",
                "description": "Tubular SB-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SB-A2 - This modern curved tubular lever is made from stainless steel and is a part of Fusion Hardware's 2000 series. The gentle curving shape not only adds a contemporary sleek look, it fits nicely in the hand. Available in either Brushed Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel finishes, this lever and rose set will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
